    "chunk_text": "Ic wat cu\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t seo stow ne bi\u00f0 noht longe \u00ebmettugu on \u00f0\u00e6re Sancte MY06A30 \u00d0a noht longe \u00e6fter \u00feissum \u00f0a geuntrumade godes se leofa Eadberht bisceop, ond \u00fe\u00e6s MY07A1 On \u00f0one seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Iohannes geleornes, se w\u00e6s biscop on MY07A3 Se gedyde dumbum men spr\u00e6ce, ond his wundor syndon awritene on istoria anglorum \u00f0\u00e6m MY08A1 On \u00f0one eahte\u00fean d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t sancte Michaheles cirice \u00e6rest funden w\u00e6s on MY08B1 On \u00f0one ylcan d\u00e6g bi\u00f0 sancte Victores \u00f0rowung \u00f0\u00e6s martyres, \u00f0\u00e6s lichoma reste\u00f0 on MY08B3 Se Victor he w\u00e6s Maura cynnes, ond he w\u00e6s Maximianus c\u00e6mpa \u00f0\u00e6s h\u00e6\u00f0nan caseres, ac MY08B6 \u00dea l\u00e6rde se casere hine \u00fe\u00e6t he forlete Cristes geleafan. MY08B7 \u00d0a he \u00fe\u00e6t ne ge\u00feafade, \u00f0a \u00fereade hine man mid witum. MY08B9 He het hine begeotan mid weallende leade, ac him \u00fe\u00e6t no ne derede \u00f0on ma \u00f0e ceald MY08B11 \u00dea het he his leaseras hine l\u00e6dan to \u00fe\u00e6m wuda se is gecegd dulnus ond hine \u00fe\u00e6r MY08B13 \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe he to \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee hine l\u00e6ddon, Secga\u00f0 ge Maximiane \u00fe\u00e6m casere \u00fe\u00e6t he bi\u00f0 to MY08B17 \u00dea bebead se casere \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6nig mon \u00feone lichoman bebyrgde si\u00f0\u00f0an he w\u00e6s beheafdod, ac MY08B21",
